(1)  403/    144A :                     ; Load a Dynamic Pattern Load Cues request into the DMA queue.
(1)  404/    144A :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
(1)  405/    144A :                     ; Input:
(1)  406/    144A :                     ;	d0.b = frame number
(1)  407/    144A :                     ;	d4.w = starting target VRAM tile address
(1)  408/    144A :                     ;	d6.l = pointer to uncompressed art
(1)  409/    144A :                     ;	a2   = pointer to DPLC table
