    3014/    3AB6 :                     
    3015/    3AB6 :                     		; PLCs have finished, load/initialize remaining data
    3016/    3AB6 :                     
    3018/    3AB6 :                     		; Do VBlank for one extra frame to provide enough processing time
    3019/    3AB6 :                     		; for the remaining data initialization below. Without it, it's 
    3020/    3AB6 :                     		; possible for VBlank to interrupt in the middle of a transfer,
    3021/    3AB6 :                     		; resulting in visual corruption. This will also make title cards
    3022/    3AB6 :                     		; smoother should decompression get upgraded with something faster.
