    3998/    50A6 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    3999/    50A6 :                     ; Subroutine controlling Sonic on the ending sequence.
    4000/    50A6 :                     ; 
    4001/    50A6 :                     ; Many aspects of the game use the concept of a state machine.
    4002/    50A6 :                     ; If you are interested and want to learn more, these are Mealy and Moore machines
    4003/    50A6 :                     ; which have plenty of resources to teach you! This subroutine is a Moore machine.
    4004/    50A6 :                     ; Once you understand these concepts, Sonic 1's game logic will make a lot more sense to you!
    4005/    50A6 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    4006/    50A6 :                     
    4007/    50A6 :                     End_MoveSonic:
    4008/    50A6 : 1038 F7D7           		move.b	(v_sonicend).w,d0		; get ending cutscene routine number
