(2)  133/    5F1C :                     ; Widescreen camera limits
(2)  134/    5F1C :                     ; The wide view shows ExtraWidth pixels either side of the normal screen, so the
(2)  135/    5F1C :                     ; camera is kept that far from the real level edges. The limit variables
(2)  136/    5F1C :                     ; themselves are left alone, because Sonic and objects use them too.
(2)  137/    5F1C :                     ; Locked arenas (boss fights) have limits too close together for this, so they
(2)  138/    5F1C :                     ; fall back to the plain limits.
(2)  139/    5F1C :                     ; output:
(2)  140/    5F1C :                     ;	d1 = effective limit
(2)  141/    5F1C :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
(2)  142/    5F1C :                     
