(1)  819/    674A :                     		; Floor the coordinates to the nearest pair of tiles (the size of a block).
(1)  820/    674A :                     		; Also note that this wraps the value to the size of the plane:
(1)  821/    674A :                     		; The plane is 64*8 wide, so wrap at $100, and it's 32*8 tall, so wrap at $200
