(1)  280/    7D24 :                     
(1)  281/    7D24 :                     Fragmentate_8x2Floor_NoReset:
(1)  282/    7D24 :                     		; After looking through all object layouts, it appears that type A (swipe)
(1)  283/    7D24 :                     		; is never used anywhere in the game. The developers probably preferred
