(1)  460/    9D40 :                     ; 
(1)  461/    9D40 :                     ; output:
(1)  462/    9D40 :                     ;	d0 = distance from side of monitor
(1)  463/    9D40 :                     ;	d1 = collision type: 0 = none; 1 = side collision; -1 = top/bottom collision
(1)  464/    9D40 :                     ;	d3 = distance from top of monitor
