(1) 1934/    E60E :                     		; When Sonic is moving down and a floor collision is detected, there exists
(1) 1935/    E60E :                     		; a check that makes it so that he doesn't clip on top of a surface that
(1) 1936/    E60E :                     		; he's too far below from. However, said check doesn't exist for when Sonic
(1) 1937/    E60E :                     		; is moving left or right. The effects of this can easily be seen if you
(1) 1938/    E60E :                     		; place a solid object on a top solid surface and hit the object from the bottom,
(1) 1939/    E60E :                     		; where Sonic's Y movement will be cancelled out, causing him to start checking
(1) 1940/    E60E :                     		; for floor collision, which makes him clip onto the surface.
