(2)  147/    EB96 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
(2)  148/    EB96 :                     ; --- Special animations (walk/run/roll/push) ---
(2)  149/    EB96 :                     ; Sonic handles animations with a start value of $80 or greater separately.
(2)  150/    EB96 :                     ; All special animations need to have EXACTLY 6 frames (plus one afEnd),
(2)  151/    EB96 :                     ; animations that are too short have extra afEnd to pad to the same length.
(2)  152/    EB96 :                     ; This is because the special animation handler switches between these
(2)  153/    EB96 :                     ; animations without resetting the animation positon.
(2)  154/    EB96 :                     
(2)  155/    EB96 : FF                  SonAni_Walk:	dc.b $FF
(2)  156/    EB97 : 0809 0A0B 0607      		dc.b fr_Walk13, fr_Walk14, fr_Walk15, fr_Walk16, fr_Walk11, fr_Walk12
(2)  157/    EB9D : FF                  		dc.b afEnd
(2)  158/    EB9E : (MACRO)              		even
