(1) 2978/    EFAE :                     ; These lines were intended to prevent the Camera from panning while
(1) 2979/    EFAE :                     ; going up the very first giant ramp in Palmtree Panic Zone Act 1.
(1) 2980/    EFAE :                     ; However, given that no such object exists in Sonic 1, I just went
(1) 2981/    EFAE :                     ; ahead and commented these out.
(1) 2982/    EFAE :                     ;		btst	#1,$2C(a0)		; Are we on a 3D ramp?
(1) 2983/    EFAE :                     ;		beq.s	.No3DRamp		; If not, branch
(1) 2984/    EFAE :                     ;		cmpi.w	#$1B00,obX(a0)		; Are we on the 3D ramp at the start of the level?
