(1)  236/   123D4 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
(1)  237/   123D4 :                     ; Palette cycle data for square blocks in Special Stages.
(1)  238/   123D4 :                     ; - Four sets for the four wall types. Each set has same blinking pattern:
(1)  239/   123D4 :                     ;   nBnnnnnB twice (n = normal palette, B = blinking palette)
(1)  240/   123D4 :                     ; - Blinking palette line is the one before the normal one (i.e. -1)
(1)  241/   123D4 :                     ; - All values are technically complete VRAM settings with the art tile,
(1)  242/   123D4 :                     ;   but the only difference between each value is the palette line
(1)  243/   123D4 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
