(1)  246/   12AF0 :                     ; Animated pattern routine - load uncompressed Giant Ring patterns
(1)  247/   12AF0 :                     ; The graphics are loaded incrementally at 14 tiles per frame.
(1)  248/   12AF0 :                     ; This gets triggered from GRing_Okay by setting v_gfxbigring to:
(1)  249/   12AF0 :                     ; Art_BigRing_size = 98 tiles * tile_size = $C40
