(1)  539/   5501E :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
(1)  540/   5501E :                     ; ===========================================================================
(1)  541/   5501E :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
(1)  542/   5501E :                     ; Extended uncompressed title card letter data. Letter art is arranged so
(1)  543/   5501E :                     ; that A-Z and a-z have ASCII-compliant distance between them. The gap is
(1)  544/   5501E :                     ; filled with the act numbers. 1 has been widened to for ease of use.
(1)  545/   5501E :                     ; "Act" text comes after lowercase z, and oval art right after that, and
(1)  546/   5501E :                     ; lastly the "BONU" and small oval used for results screens.
(1)  547/   5501E :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
